  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tandoor or clay pot to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of butter and duck fat in the preheated tandoor or clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sauté for another minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the cauliflower, carrots, ground ginger, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the pistachios, chopped parsley, and the remaining 2 tablespoons of butter. Stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to the preheated tandoor or clay pot with the remaining 2 tablespoons of duck fat or oil.",
    "Cook for 20 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender and the pistachios are fragrant.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
